<newsitem itemid="155492" id="root" date="1996-10-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: Scoa narrows first-half loss.</title>
<headline>Scoa narrows first-half loss.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		    loss  18.9  vs     loss 47.8</p>
<p>    Net				     loss  17.2  vs     loss 26.5</p>
<p>    Operating			   profit  68.2  vs   profit 44.8</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional	profit  51.4  vs   profit 26.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional			 charge  42.1  vs   charge 25.1</p>
<p>    Financial expense			   16.8  vs	    18.8</p>
<p>    Turnover				     861.1  vs	   993.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Scoa reported first-half results in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
